# Agent routing

**Main entry:** `/orcha` → `.cursor/commands/orcha.md` → agent `.cursor/agents/orchestrator.md`

Skim `.cursor/playbooks/core/TASK_ROUTER.md` before non-trivial work.

**Task tool:** see `.cursor/agents/SUBAGENT_MAP.md` for local agent ↔ `subagent_type` mapping.

**UI:** use UI Engineer with **app-ui** + **shadcn**.

**Update stack:** `pnpm cpt sync` syncs from `@andrewnleon/cursor-agent-starter`.
